"                                gardes. Gravez ensuite la pastille depuis « Mes pastilles »\n"
"                                dans l'application."
msgstr ""
"The buttons offered when the phone comes close. Each plays its gesture on "
"the tag's record, with its own safeguards. Then engrave the tag from “My "
"tags” in the app."

